### Get CPU RAM Compatibility Entries
GET {{PcBuilderBackend.Api_HostAddress}}/api/catalog/cpu/{{cpuId}}/ram-compats
Accept: application/json

###

### Replace CPU RAM Compatibility Entries
PUT {{PcBuilderBackend.Api_HostAddress}}/api/catalog/cpu/{{cpuId}}/ram-compats
Content-Type: {{ContentType}}
Accept: application/json

[
  {
    "ddrGeneration": 5,
    "ramModuleCount": 2,
    "ramRank": 1,
    "maxSpeedMts": 5200
  },
  {
    "ddrGeneration": 5,
    "ramModuleCount": 4,
    "ramRank": 2,
    "maxSpeedMts": 3600
  }
]

